<title>SPAIN: Revised Spanish M4 figures for September.</title>
<headline>Revised Spanish M4 figures for September.</headline>
<dateline>MADRID 1996-11-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Bank of Spain, which earlier</p>
<p>released provisional M4 figures for October, subsequently</p>
<p>published revised data as follows:</p>
<p> MONEY SUPPLY		   Oct 96	Sept 96     Aug 96</p>
<p> M4 pct rise		     12.4	  9.3	   2.5</p>
<p> Domestic credit pct rise     2.1	 10.1	   4.0</p>
<p>NOTE - Latest month's data are provisional. Previous are both revised. Percentage monthly rises are on annualised basis.</p>
</text>
